  "name": "Confit Salmon with Tahini, Pistachio and Herb Crust",
  "subtitle": "Slow-cooked salmon with a creamy tahini sauce and fresh herb topping",
  "description": "Cure salmon briefly with lemon and salt, then gently cook it in spiced olive oil. Serve with tahini yogurt sauce and a bright pistachio, herb, chilli, and pomegranate topping.",
